WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.815 --> 00:00:08.335
Your school has invited you to Fixer Nation Education. This video shows you how to accept the invitation and get started.

2
00:00:08.839 --> 00:00:18.019
Open the email that says you're invited to join your school. If you can't find it, check your spam folder. The invitation is open for fourteen days.

3
00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:21.939
Select the button in the email to open your invitation.

4
00:00:22.441 --> 00:00:30.051
If you're new to Fixer Nation, you'll see a form. Your school's name is at the top, and your email address is already filled in.

5
00:00:30.551 --> 00:00:38.701
Enter your first name, last name, and a password with at least eight characters. Then type the password again to confirm it.

6
00:00:39.201 --> 00:00:47.711
Select Create Account and Accept Invitation. There's nothing to verify by email, because the invitation already went to your address.

7
00:00:48.213 --> 00:00:58.993
When it's done, you'll see a confirmation. Select Go to My Account. The green banner at the top confirms your license is active, and you can start browsing lesson plans from there.

8
00:00:59.495 --> 00:01:07.715
If you already have an account with the same email, and you're signed in, you'll see a single button. Select Accept Invitation, and you're done.

9
00:01:08.217 --> 00:01:17.157
If you have an account but you're not signed in, the page asks for your password instead. Enter it, and select Sign In and Accept Invitation.

10
00:01:17.657 --> 00:01:25.797
If you've forgotten your password, the Forgot your password link sends you a reset email, and brings you back to the invitation afterward.

11
00:01:26.299 --> 00:01:33.649
From now on, sign in on the Teacher Login page with your email and password. Your classrooms are waiting there.

12
00:01:34.151 --> 00:01:42.771
If you see a message that the invitation has expired, been used, or been cancelled, ask your school administrator to send a new one.
